  - Enums: PlanType, TransactionType
  - `frontend/src/types/`
  
- **1.8** Configurar API Client (2h)
  - Axios client com interceptors
  - Endpoints organizados por recurso
  - `frontend/src/lib/api/`

- **8.1** Hook useAuth (2h)
  - Context de autenticação
  - Login, logout, register (mock inicial)
  - `frontend/src/hooks/useAuth.ts`

- **8.2** Hook useCredits (1.5h)
  - Gerenciamento de créditos
  - `frontend/src/hooks/useCredits.ts`

**Subtotal Crítico:** ~6.5h

